Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.71,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.24,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}命さえ晒し唄えば
