Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.06,0:01:33.98,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己没有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.04,0:01:49.31,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但这能成为苟且偷生的借口吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.55,0:01:52.01,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在内心深处响起的悲鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.12,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由谁来回应
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.12,0:01:58.02,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那么几次
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.76,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做个正直的当事者
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.61,0:02:06.17,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.19,0:02:11.73,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐惧吗 再次睁开双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.06,0:02:16.45,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.45,0:02:18.45,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已经察觉到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.45,0:02:20.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身体已无法停滞不前
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.08,0:02:25.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.33,0:02:28.95,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「这点恐惧便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.71,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.24,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放声高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.17,0:02:35.56,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.57,0:02:38.31,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.60,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.82,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在这里结束吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.82,0:02:46.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}这绝非你所愿吧
