Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:33.24,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}不惜性命放声高歌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:35.56,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:38.31,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}此刻你便知晓
